Subject: [PATCH] feat(common): add AcademicFormatValidator manuscript
 integrity audits (PR3)

Domain-agnostic pre-submission audits for generated papers: number-consistency (every decimal must be in a caller-supplied sanctioned registry), citation whitelist vs BibTeX database, and abstract presence/word-limit. Guards the FARS internal-consistency failure mode (numbers mixed across runs) and hallucinated citations. Consumed by miniFARS FormatAgent.
